{
  "slug": "skill-validator",
  "name": "Skill Validator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Health checker for Claude Code skills and commands. Scans ~/.claude/skills/ and commands/ for broken file references, deprecated MCP tool usage, missing frontmatter, script syntax errors, and  outdated versions. Supports auto-fix with backup and GitHub update checking.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands**, `skill-validate-fix` (Auto-fix repairable issues in installed Claude Code skills), `skill-validate` (Validate and repair installed Claude Code skills).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install skill-validator@claude-community` from `aliksir/skill-validator`.\n\nValidate and repair Claude Code skills — detect broken references, deprecated tools, syntax errors, and auto-fix issues.",
